  "description": "Asks whether embedded U+0000 is carried and compared as counted text. Subjects A, A+NUL, A+NUL+B, A+NUL+C (Pat group p11) through Len, '=', LIKE A*, A? and A??; a SQL literal containing NUL in a WHERE; and an undeclared pattern parameter [pp] alternated between A\\0B, A\\0C, A\\0B, A\\0* and A on one QueryDef. Then a dynaset is opened with pp = A\\0B, pp is changed to A\\0C, and the dynaset is requeried, to ask whether a stale pattern is reused. Fixture r-expr-1-main2 is opened read-only through DAO.DBEngine.120; engine version and loaded modules are recorded; each recordset reads Name, Type and Value of every field.",
  "retentionNote": "Worker died inside Recordset.Requery (see evidence/r-crash-requery: Requery(QueryDef) faults inside ACEDAO). Execution stays Uncertain; the lifecycle trace, where present, names the call.",
